# pgvector

## Mục tiêu

pgvector là một PostgreSQL extension cho phép store và query vector embeddings trực tiếp trong database. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, pgvector đóng vai trò quan trọng trong việc implement AI-powered features như semantic search, similarity matching, và RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation). Mục tiêu của rule này là hướng dẫn developers trong việc sử dụng pgvector hiệu quả cho vector storage và similarity search.

pgvector enable developers để xây dựng AI features mà không cần separate vector database, đơn giản hóa architecture và giảm operational complexity. Việc kết hợp vector search với traditional SQL queries tạo ra powerful hybrid search capabilities.

## Nguyên tắc

**1. Vector Dimension Planning**

Choose appropriate dimensions. 768 for text-embedding-3. 1536 for text-embedding-ada-002. 384-1024 for small models. Consider storage vs accuracy.

**2. Index Selection**

HNSW for best quality. IVFFlat for faster inserts. Consider memory usage. Test with real data. Choose based on use case.

**3. Distance Metrics**

Cosine similarity for normalized vectors. L2 distance for geometric similarity. Inner product for recommendation. Match to embedding model.

**4. Hybrid Search**

Combine vector and keyword search. Use pre-filtering. Consider late filtering. Balance relevance. Optimize for both.

**5. Data Consistency**

Synchronize embeddings with source data. Handle updates carefully. Delete orphaned embeddings. Use transactions. Monitor consistency.

**6. Performance Optimization**

Batch embedding generation. Use connection pooling. Index maintenance. Monitor query performance. Optimize batch size.

**7. Schema Design**

Co-locate vectors with source data. Use proper data types. Add metadata columns. Index appropriately. Consider partitioning.

**8. Embedding Management**

Use consistent embedding model. Version embeddings. Monitor embedding quality. Regenerate when needed. Document model choices.

**9. Error Handling**

Handle embedding generation failures. Handle query failures. Monitor for corruption. Implement retries. Log errors.

**10. Security Considerations**

Protect embedding data. Implement access control. Secure API keys. Audit access. Monitor usage.

